- **Author must be `wahidullahr`** (`wahidullahr <89798201+wahidullahr@users.noreply.github.com>`).
- Do **not** change global `git config`. If the local repo author is wrong, pass `--author` on the commit, or ensure this repo’s local `user.name` / `user.email` match wahidullahr before committing.
- Never commit as `xalatechnologies`, Cursor, or another identity.

## `gh` / pull requests

- Prefer the **`wahidullahr`** GitHub CLI account (`gh auth switch --user wahidullahr` when needed) so PRs are opened by wahidullahr.
